<title>UK: Turkey's Emlak sets 150 mln mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Turkey's Emlak sets 150 mln mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and UBS Germany.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TURKIYE EMLAK BANKASI A.S.</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON     8.50 PCT  MATURITY    09.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    09.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.0	LISTING    FFM</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/TURKEY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    1.50	SELL CONC  0.50</p>
<p> LIST FEE   0.50</p>
<p> NOTES	EMLAK IS 99.9 PCT OWNED BT TURKISH TREASURY.</p>
<p>		THERE IS A 75 PCT OWNERSHIP MAINTENANCE CLAUSE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
